  "oldData": "No migration, persistence or history expansion. Existing passes, goals and ledger remain valid and idempotent. Editing invalidates the current run; accepted historical facts remain historical.",
  "rollback": "Keep prior immutable registration/authorization files. Roll back only a matched frontend/engine/resource set; never downgrade SAVE, erase browser data or write unknown new drafts. Drafts are ephemeral and not sent to any remote execution service.",
  "scope": "13.2 only. Explicit in-place code synchronization entry; automatic/show/hide preferences and preferred editor integration remain P0.5-08. No 13.3 locks, 13.4 persistent history, 13.5 exercises, course expansion or P2 workbench.",
  "decisions": [
    "Reject over-32KiB or malformed-Unicode input atomically, retain the complete pre-edit draft and show a local rejection; never truncate.",
    "Canonical synthetic-tail provenance is trusted only from own generation/patch transactions; direct code replacement without a proven input delta drops synthetic proof.",
    "An unchanged projection must retain native Blockly coordinates and undo/redo history.",
    "Draft first-input source and retained execution source/case identity are separate projections of the same frozen document.",
    "Unmapped issues and Rust diagnostics with current ranges expose line/column selection, focus and scroll without requiring a mapped Session.ready state."
  ],
